WEBVTT

00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:03.850
Is Falulu here yet?

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:09.440
I can't wait to hear about her time at PriPari, the capital of flowers and fashion-pri!

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.860
