00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:14.430
But I'm still max upset!

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:15.820
That stupid Phantom Thief Genius.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:19.090
He made a fool of us by stealing our coord and calling our friendship fake.

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:20.340
It is irritating-pri!

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.080
Yeah.

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:22.590
Oh well.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:25.800
Falulu and Unicorn are finally coming back to see us!

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.290
Let's enjoy the day.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:33.010
It's been so long since I've seen Unicorn-sama that I'm getting excited-kuma!

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:38.280
Anyway, when she turned into a Pegasus, she became a Legendary Mascot-usa!

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.430
With that, there's no way we could be rude-kuma!

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:49.900
That divine light...

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:53.240
Unicorn-sama!

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:56.200
It's such a dazzling light, Unicorn-sama!

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:11.700
Long time no see-dechu.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:14.170
Huh? You're back to normal-kuma?

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:16.010
I turned back after two days-dechu.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:20.290
All right, you can also get off, Falulu.

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:23.100
Also, watch your step-dechu.

00:01:28.690 --> 00:01:30.520
Falulu!

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:37.110
Lala! Girls!

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:40.220
It's been too long!

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:41.490
We finally get to see each other again!

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:44.120
Yeah. Everyone seems to be doing well.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:45.650
So do you!

00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:49.580
Since you're back, here's my extremely happy capisce!

00:01:49.580 --> 00:02:00.930
Capisce! Capisce!

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:04.780
Eh?!
Capisce! Capisce!

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:06.890
Capisce! Capisce!

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:41.300
Falulu Has Returned-dechu.

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:44.530
Falulu-sama, welcome back!

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:46.490
I'm back, Non-chan.

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:51.000
Being able to talk with my beloved Falulu-sama again is like a dream come true!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:55.400
But Non, haven't you said that you like Fuwari-chan lately?

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:58.210
