00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:11.850
We also went out and bought stylish PriPari souvenirs for the rest of you.

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:16.560
PriPari cookies!

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:18.050
A pendant-pri!

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:19.280
It's so cute!

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:21.740
This is pretty stylish!

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:24.450
Thank you very much.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:27.160
Even a Go table!

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:30.300
Um, what about us?

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:32.050
Did you get anything-usa?

00:04:32.050 --> 00:04:35.140
We got a special present for the two of you-dechu.

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:35.630
Hooray-usa!

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:38.270
Your generosity is much appreciated-kuma!

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:42.880
I'm sure it's a wonderful item worthy of an exceedingly handsome gentleman such as myself-usa.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:45.340
Eh?

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:47.800
Huh?

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:50.880
It seems they're so impressed they're speechless-dechu.

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:53.270
It's great that they like them.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:57.230
It looks like the two of you are still good friends.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.050
Of course-dechu.

00:04:59.050 --> 00:05:02.290
But I am also a capable manager-dechu.

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:07.330
We're trying to achieve her dream of being a Divine Idol, so there are still times when I have to scold her.

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:08.950
Falulu understands.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.660
<i>Come on, Falulu!</i>

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:14.440
