00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:17.150
<i>No, that wasn't harsh enough.</i>

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:19.010
<i>I need to be stricter!</i>

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:20.200
<i>Me-me!</i>

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:24.120
