00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:25.280
No!

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:28.430
Don't tell them that-dechu!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.560
More importantly...

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:40.220
Unicorn's tail is spiral poop!

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:43.520
Spiral poop!

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:45.020
Why you!

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:47.900
If you don't shut your traps I'll get angry!

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:53.910
Um, now that we're on the topic,
just what are these little things-pri?

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:58.230
These Mini Falulu are all the same as Falulu-dechu.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:05:59.500
Wait, that means...

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:02.210
