00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:04.230
Exactly.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:11.350
I now have the job of visiting the different PriParas and collecting dropped PriTickets.

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:12.930
And then...

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:20.560
These girls are born from the feelings of girls who wanted to become idols.

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:46.980
They are awoken as Vocal Dolls just like Falulu-dechu.

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:50.050
Falulu also helps me with it-dechu.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.220
Falu!

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:55.640
Falulu-oneechan!

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.840
So they're all Falulu's little sisters.

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:00.480
They're all so cute!

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.610
But aren't there a bit too many-pri?

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:04.230
What's "-pri"?

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:04.680
