00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:26.520
Malu!
O Sole, O Sole Mio.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:27.220
Maalu!

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:27.740
Faalulu!

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:28.210
Chalulu!

