00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.060
It's pointless-dechu.

00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:35.520
Falulu and the other girls were all born when feelings of becoming idols came together.

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:38.780
But Gaalulu is different.

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:39.860
Huh?

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:43.500
Even though girls normally strive to be sparkling idols,

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:46.620
it doesn't always go that way-dechu.

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:48.900
<i>I can't sing.</i>

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:50.770
<i>I cannot dance.</i>

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:53.650
<i>I don't want to do or see any more concerts!</i>

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:56.380
<i>Maybe it's impossible for me to be an idol...</i>

00:19:57.350 --> 00:19:59.870
They couldn't become what they wanted.

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:04.050
Those girls' gloomy feelings gathered together...

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:17.240
And that's how Gaalulu was born-dechu.

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:20.030
Gaalulu...

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:23.540
She said she hates idols...

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:25.990
Sophie, you can understand her-pri?

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:27.700
Gaalulu!

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:31.120
She said she wants to be a monster...

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:35.210
Gaalulu...

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:41.260
It went by so quickly, but you really helped us-dechu!

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:43.200
Thank you.

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:45.450
Did all of you learn a lot?

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:46.470
Yeah!

00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:49.180
All right, now start!

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:53.140
Capisce-pri-kyupikon!

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.580
Good job!

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:56.100
That's all...?

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:58.800
All right, get on up there,

00:20:58.800 --> 00:20:59.680
Maaruru,

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:00.570
Naaruru,

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:01.470
Charuru,

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:02.610
Pyaruru...

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:05.080
They could have stayed longer...

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:08.470
Unicorn has her own work to attend to, so there's no helping it-pri.

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:10.540
But we'll see each other soon, right?

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:12.680
99...

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:13.710
Huh?

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:15.000
We're missing one-dechu!

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:16.420
Eh?!

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:19.630
Our flight bound for PriPari will be taking off shortly.

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:21.840
Eh?!

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:23.080
This is bad!

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:24.300
Gaalulu's not onboard!

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:26.760
Eh?! Gaalulu's not?!

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:07.170
Gaalulu ran away?

00:23:07.170 --> 00:23:07.940
Why?

00:23:07.940 --> 00:23:11.030
I wonder if there's something she doesn't like.

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:13.870
She's bitten a lot of people!

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:15.650
We have to find her quickly.

00:23:15.650 --> 00:23:17.080
I may not have much energy,

00:23:17.080 --> 00:23:18.370
but I'll do everything I can.

00:23:18.370 --> 00:23:19.660
Gaalulu!

00:23:20.610 --> 00:23:23.210
Gaalulu's in the system control room!?

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:24.400
Don't do that!

00:23:24.400 --> 00:23:25.710
We're coming!

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:27.330
Wait for us, Gaalulu.

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:28.770
Next time:

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:30.160
It's Sunny Once In A While.

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:31.600
Gaalulu!

00:23:31.600 --> 00:23:32.960
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:32.960 --> 00:23:34.550
Let's go PriPara!
